What is the sunk cost fallacy?
#v(40pt)
// From the start until section one, the option is black. From section 2 until the end it is then turned red, because it is incorrect.
#only("-1")[a) Ignoring past investments]#only("2-")[#text(fill:red)[a) Ignoring past investments]]
#v(10pt)
// From the start until section two, the option is black. From section 3 until the end it is then turned green, because it is correct.
#only("-2")[b) Continuing an endeavor due to past investments]#only("3-")[#text(fill:green)[b) Continuing an endeavor due to past investments]]
#v(10pt)
// From the start until section three, the option is black. From section 4 until the end it is then turned red, because it is incorrect.
